Warning [L0504]: field `price` looks like money but has type `Float`
  --> tests/ui_lint/float_money.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     price: Float
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: floating-point money loses cents on common values like `0.1 + 0.2`
 Fix: use `Decimal` for exact money, or suppress with `#[allow(float_money)]` on the field

Warning [L0502]: comparing floats with `==` is unreliable
  --> tests/ui_lint/float_money.jet:1:8
    |
  1 | struct Invoice {
    |        ^^^^^^^
 Why: floating-point arithmetic is inexact; two values computed differently may not be bit-identical even when mathematically equal
 Fix: compare within a tolerance: `(a - b).abs() < 1e-9`
